{
  "id": "36kr",
  "name": {
    "default": "36Kr",
    "en": "36Kr",
    "zh": "36氪",
    "ja": "36Kr"
  },
  "description": {
    "default": "36Kr hot list and newsflashes from RSSHub.",
    "en": "36Kr hot list and newsflashes from RSSHub.",
    "zh": "基于 RSSHub 的 36氪热榜与快讯。",
    "ja": "RSSHub から 36Kr のホットリストと速報を表示します。"
  },
  "docs": "# 36Kr\n\n36氪阅读小工具。后台 job 从 RSSHub 拉取两个 feed：\n\n- `https://rsshub.rssforever.com/36kr/hot-list` → 热榜\n- `https://rsshub.rssforever.com/36kr/newsflashes` → 快讯\n\n## Tabs\n\n- **热榜**：36氪 24 小时热榜，适合浏览长文和综合热点。\n- **快讯**：36氪实时快讯，按发布时间倒序。\n\n## XML\n\n使用 `xml` wasm plugin 的 `xml.rss` 动作解析 RSS/Atom；开发时请 link `xml` 插件。\n",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "min_runtime": "0.1.7",
  "license": "MIT",
  "renderer": "auto",
  "author": "aglet-dev",
  "category": "media",
  "keywords": [
    "36kr",
    "rss",
    "news",
    "china",
    "startup"
  ],
  "icon": "https://api.iconify.design/ph/newspaper-clipping-fill.svg?color=%23111111&width=256",
  "permissions": [
    "data:read",
    "data:write"
  ],
  "requires": [
    {
      "plugin": "xml",
      "range": ">=0.1.0"
    }
  ],
  "window": {
    "style": "phone",
    "width": 420,
    "height": 820,
    "resizable": false
  },
  "jobs": [
    {
      "id": "ingest",
      "run": "ingest",
      "every": 300000,
      "while": "always"
    }
  ],
  "collections": {
    "hot_items": {
      "schema": {
        "guid": { "type": "string" },
        "title": { "type": "string" },
        "url": { "type": "string" },
        "summary": { "type": "string" },
        "published_at": { "type": "string" },
        "published_ts": { "type": "number" },
        "source": { "type": "string" }
      },
      "indexes": ["guid", "published_ts"]
    },
    "newsflashes": {
      "schema": {
        "guid": { "type": "string" },
        "title": { "type": "string" },
        "url": { "type": "string" },
        "summary": { "type": "string" },
        "published_at": { "type": "string" },
        "published_ts": { "type": "number" },
        "source": { "type": "string" }
      },
      "indexes": ["guid", "published_ts"]
    }
  },
  "state": {
    "sync_error": ""
  },
  "shots": {
    "seed": "36kr.shots.seed.json",
    "locales": ["en", "zh"],
    "themes": ["dark", "light"],
    "frames": [
      { "id": "hot", "caption": { "default": "China tech, ranked by the crowd", "zh": "24 小时科技热榜" } },
      { "id": "flash", "state": { "/state/_ui/tabs/main": "flash" }, "caption": { "default": "Real-time startup newsflashes", "zh": "实时创投快讯" } }
    ]
  }
}
